nty&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and May to June came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 202% of normal in May to June and 45% in August to September. Grid 15773 has a preliminary estimate of 57.2 for August to September 2026, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ. Grid 15471 had its driest year in 1954 at 54%.</p>"}
